## Known Issues / Tech Debt

| Issue | Severity | Fix |
|-------|----------|-----|
| DSN passed raw in WS messages | High | Move to connection_id (Plan 4) |
| Auth is O(n × argon2) per WS connect | Medium | Add username to auth payload |
| Rate limit is per-connection, not per-user | Low | Shared rate limit map keyed by user_id |
| `connected` pill never goes grey mid-session | Low | Add `ws.onclose` callback after auth |
| No SSH tunnel support | Low | Plan 4 connection wizard |

